<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Media Protocol Test - OFF-THE-RECORD</title>

<!-- Apply theme before CSS loads to prevent FOUC -->
<script>
    (function() {
        if (localStorage.getItem('reader_theme') === 'dark') {
            document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', 'dark');
        }
    })();
</script>

<!-- Site CSS -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/fonts.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/reset.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/variables.min.css">

<style>
  /* ─── MEDIA TEST PAGE CUSTOM STYLES ─── */
  :root {
    --mtp-navy: #1B2A4A;
    --mtp-red: #C0392B;
    --mtp-cream: #FAF9F6;
    --mtp-gray: #6b7280;
    --mtp-light-gray: #e5e7eb;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] {
    --mtp-navy: #0d1526;
    --mtp-cream: var(--color-background);
    --mtp-gray: #9ca3af;
    --mtp-light-gray: #374151;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    background: var(--color-background);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ─── HEADER ─── */
  header {
    background: var(--mtp-navy);
    color: white;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  header h1 span { color: var(--mtp-red); }
  header p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #8899aa;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ─── MAIN ─── */
  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mtp-red);
    margin: 60px 0 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 30px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] h2 {
    color: #93c5fd;
  }

  p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  p.note { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--mtp-gray); font-style: italic; }

  /* ─── IMAGE CONTAINERS ─── */
  .image-test {
    margin: 30px 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-background-secondary);
  }

  .image-test .label-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: var(--mtp-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #8899aa;
  }
  .label-bar .type { color: var(--mtp-red); font-weight: 700; }
  .label-bar .specs { color: #667788; }

  .image-test .img-wrapper {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-background-tertiary);
  }

  .image-test .img-wrapper img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .image-test .meta {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--mtp-gray);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .meta span { white-space: nowrap; }
  .meta .pass { color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700; }
  .meta .warn { color: #d97706; font-weight: 700; }
  .meta .fail { color: var(--mtp-red); font-weight: 700; }

  /* ─── DEVICE PREVIEW ─── */
  .device-preview {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 30px 0;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .device {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 260px;
  }

  .device-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mtp-gray);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .phone-frame {
    width: 280px;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }

  .phone-screen {
    background: var(--mtp-cream);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 20px 14px;
  }

  .phone-screen .mock-header {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--mtp-gray);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .phone-screen .mock-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .phone-screen img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .desktop-frame {
    background: #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }

  .desktop-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .desktop-bar .dot {
    width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #555;
  }
  .desktop-bar .dot:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f57; }
  .desktop-bar .dot:nth-child(2) { background: #febc2e; }
  .desktop-bar .dot:nth-child(3) { background: #28c840; }

  .desktop-screen {
    background: var(--mtp-cream);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 30px 40px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .desktop-screen .mock-header {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--mtp-gray);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .desktop-screen .mock-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .desktop-screen img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  /* ─── SPEC TABLE ─── */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  th {
    background: var(--mtp-navy);
    color: white;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--color-background-secondary); }

  /* ─── VERDICT BOX ─── */
  .verdict {
    background: var(--mtp-navy);
    color: white;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }
  .verdict h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--mtp-red);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .verdict p {
    color: #c0c8d4;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .verdict .result {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #28c840;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--mtp-gray);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  /* Simulated content styling */
  .sim-photo {
    min-height: 240px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .sim-photo-content {
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .sim-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .sim-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .sim-specs {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #8ab4d0;
  }

  /* Vertical photo sim */
  .vertical-photo-sim {
    width: 260px;
    height: 360px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f5f5f0 0%, #e0d8c8 100%);
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .vertical-photo-sim {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2a2a 0%, #1f1f1f 100%);
    border-color: #444;
  }
  .vertical-photo-sim .inner {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .vertical-photo-sim .sim-label {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .vertical-photo-sim .sim-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .vertical-photo-sim .sim-title {
    color: #aaa;
  }
  .vertical-photo-sim .sim-specs {
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #aaa;
  }

  /* Phone screenshot sim */
  .phone-screenshot-sim {
    width: 220px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .phone-screenshot-sim {
    background: #1f1f1f;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .imessage-header {
    font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    max-width: 80%;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble.received {
    background: #e5e5ea;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble.received {
    background: #3a3a3a;
    color: #e0e0e0;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble.sent {
    background: #007AFF;
    color: white;
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble-row {
    display: flex;
  }
  .phone-screenshot-sim .bubble-row.right {
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  /* Tweet sim */
  .tweet-sim {
    width: 400px;
    max-width: 100%;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e1e8ed;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .tweet-sim {
    background: #1f1f1f;
    border-color: #333;
  }
  .tweet-sim .tweet-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .tweet-sim .avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mtp-navy);
  }
  .tweet-sim .name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .tweet-sim .handle {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #536471;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .tweet-sim .handle {
    color: #8899a6;
  }
  .tweet-sim .tweet-body {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .tweet-sim .tweet-meta {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #536471;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e1e8ed;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .tweet-sim .tweet-meta {
    color: #8899a6;
    border-color: #333;
  }

  /* Device preview photo placeholders */
  .device-photo-placeholder {
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .device-photo-placeholder span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* Ordered list styling */
  ol {
    margin: 16px 0 16px 24px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  ol li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    header {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .device-preview {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .phone-frame {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Auth check -->
    <script>
        (function() {
            var session = localStorage.getItem('otr_beta_session');
            if (!session) {
                window.location.replace('./');
                return;
            }
            try {
                var data = JSON.parse(session);
                if (!data.authenticated || Date.now() > data.expires) {
                    localStorage.removeItem('otr_beta_session');
                    window.location.replace('./');
                    return;
                }
            } catch (e) {
                window.location.replace('./');
                return;
            }
        })();
    </script>

<header>
  <h1>OFF-THE-<span>RECORD</span></h1>
  <p>MEDIA PROTOCOL - VISUAL TEST PAGE</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <p class="section-title">THE PROBLEM</p>
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <p>Your site will contain five types of media: photos (press box, behind-the-scenes), phone screenshots (text messages, tweets), desktop screenshots, document scans (whiteboards, notes), and video stills. Each has different native dimensions, aspect ratios, and compression needs. The protocol standardizes all of them so they look intentional - not random.</p>
  <p>Below are test renders for each image type, shown inside mobile and desktop device frames exactly as they'd appear on your site. Every image follows the protocol specs.</p>

  <!-- TEST 1: HORIZONTAL PHOTO -->
  <p class="section-title">TEST 1</p>
  <h2>Horizontal Photo (16:9)</h2>
  <p>Press box shots, stadium views, behind-the-scenes. This is your most common photo type. Protocol renders these full-width at 1440px, compressed to WebP at 82%.</p>

  <div class="image-test">
    <div class="label-bar">
      <span class="type">HORIZONTAL PHOTO - 16:9</span>
      <span class="specs">1440 x 810px - WebP 82%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="img-wrapper sim-photo" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3a5c 0%, #2c5f8a 40%, #4a8ab5 70%, #1a3a5c 100%);">
      <div class="sim-photo-content">
        <div class="sim-label">SIMULATED PHOTO</div>
        <div class="sim-title">Comerica Park - Press Box View</div>
        <div class="sim-specs">1440 x 810px @ 82% WebP ~ 120KB</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>Format: <strong>WebP</strong></span>
      <span>Dimensions: <strong>1440 x 810</strong></span>
      <span>File size: <strong>~120KB</strong></span>
      <span>Aspect: <strong>16:9</strong></span>
      <span class="pass">PASS - Under 250KB target</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="note">Horizontal photos fill the full content width on both mobile and desktop. On phones, the browser downscales from 1440px to ~780px - still Retina-sharp, zero wasted bandwidth.</p>

  <!-- TEST 2: VERTICAL PHOTO -->
  <p class="section-title">TEST 2</p>
  <h2>Vertical Photo (4:5 / 9:16)</h2>
  <p>Phone camera shots of whiteboards, hallway moments, vertical behind-the-scenes. These are taller than they are wide. The protocol does NOT force these to 16:9 - it keeps the natural aspect ratio and caps the width at 1440px (or native width if smaller).</p>

  <div class="image-test">
    <div class="label-bar">
      <span class="type">VERTICAL PHOTO - 3:4</span>
      <span class="specs">1080 x 1440px - WebP 82%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="img-wrapper" style="background: var(--color-background-tertiary); min-height: 400px;">
      <div class="vertical-photo-sim">
        <div class="inner">
          <div class="sim-label">SIMULATED PHOTO</div>
          <div class="sim-title">Whiteboard<br>- Clubhouse Notes</div>
          <div class="sim-specs">1080 x 1440px<br>@ 82% WebP ~ 140KB</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>Format: <strong>WebP</strong></span>
      <span>Dimensions: <strong>1080 x 1440</strong></span>
      <span>File size: <strong>~140KB</strong></span>
      <span>Aspect: <strong>3:4</strong></span>
      <span class="pass">PASS - Natural ratio preserved</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="note">Vertical photos display narrower than full-width - they center in the content column with space on either side (desktop) or fill most of the phone screen width. This looks natural and intentional.</p>

  <!-- TEST 3: PHONE SCREENSHOT -->
  <p class="section-title">TEST 3</p>
  <h2>Phone Screenshot (Text Messages)</h2>
  <p>This is your evidence - the 250,000 text messages, the iMessage threads with players and agents. These are narrow and tall. The protocol keeps them at native width (typically 1170px for iPhone) and does NOT stretch them.</p>

  <div class="image-test">
    <div class="label-bar">
      <span class="type">PHONE SCREENSHOT - TEXT MESSAGES</span>
      <span class="specs">900 x 1600px - WebP 82%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="img-wrapper" style="padding: 30px;">
      <div class="phone-screenshot-sim">
        <div class="imessage-header">iMessage - 2:47 PM</div>
        <div class="bubble-row">
          <div class="bubble received">Hey man, you hear anything about the trade?</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bubble-row right">
          <div class="bubble sent">Working on it. Hearing names but nothing confirmed yet.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bubble-row">
          <div class="bubble received">Keep me posted</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bubble-row right">
          <div class="bubble sent">Always.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>Format: <strong>WebP</strong></span>
      <span>Dimensions: <strong>900 x 1600</strong></span>
      <span>File size: <strong>~65KB</strong></span>
      <span>Aspect: <strong>~9:16 (native)</strong></span>
      <span class="pass">PASS - Text crisp, natural width</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="note">Screenshots display at their natural width - narrower than full-width photos. This is intentional. They look like what they are: phone screens. Stretching them to fill the column would make text blurry and break the illusion.</p>

  <!-- TEST 4: DESKTOP SCREENSHOT -->
  <p class="section-title">TEST 4</p>
  <h2>Desktop Screenshot (Tweet / Social Post)</h2>
  <p>Embedded tweets, Deadspin front pages, social media posts. These are wider than phone screenshots but often not full 16:9. Protocol renders at 1080-1440px width.</p>

  <div class="image-test">
    <div class="label-bar">
      <span class="type">DESKTOP SCREENSHOT - TWEET</span>
      <span class="specs">1080 x 600px - WebP 82%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="img-wrapper" style="padding: 30px;">
      <div class="tweet-sim">
        <div class="tweet-header">
          <div class="avatar"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="name">Anthony Fenech</div>
            <div class="handle">@anthonyfenech</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tweet-body">Is this thing still on?</div>
        <div class="tweet-meta">2:14 PM - Jan 27, 2025 - <strong>385K</strong> Views</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>Format: <strong>WebP</strong></span>
      <span>Dimensions: <strong>1080 x 600</strong></span>
      <span>File size: <strong>~55KB</strong></span>
      <span>Aspect: <strong>~16:9</strong></span>
      <span class="pass">PASS - Clean render, text sharp</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DEVICE COMPARISON -->
  <p class="section-title">DEVICE COMPARISON</p>
  <h2>Same Image, Two Devices</h2>
  <p>Here's how the same photo renders inside a mobile frame versus a desktop frame. The 1440px width serves both perfectly - the phone downscales, the desktop displays near-native.</p>

  <div class="device-preview">
    <div class="device">
      <div class="device-label">iPhone (390px viewport)</div>
      <div class="phone-frame">
        <div class="phone-screen">
          <div class="mock-header">anthonyfenech.com/story</div>
          <div class="mock-text">The press box at Comerica Park sits above the world. From up here, the field looks like a stage, and every player is performing whether they know it or not.</div>
          <div class="device-photo-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3a5c, #4a8ab5); height: 110px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            <span style="font-size: 0.5rem;">PHOTO - 1440px -> 780px</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-text">I settled into the seat that would become mine for the next five seasons. Nobody tells you how lonely it gets up here.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="device" style="flex: 1.5;">
      <div class="device-label">Desktop (1440px viewport)</div>
      <div class="desktop-frame">
        <div class="desktop-bar">
          <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="desktop-screen">
          <div class="mock-header">anthonyfenech.com/story</div>
          <div class="mock-text">The press box at Comerica Park sits above the world. From up here, the field looks like a stage, and every player is performing whether they know it or not.</div>
          <div class="device-photo-placeholder" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a3a5c, #4a8ab5); height: 160px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
